  "id": "authoritative-parenting",
  "term": "authoritative parenting",
  "definition": "Authoritative parenting is a parenting style discussed in family education research as an influence on children’s and adolescents’ behavioral problems. In this context, it refers to a way of parenting that can affect behavior and the parent–child relationship.",
